Child Eater</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression &amp; lore will unlock over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 1980s eastern bloc environment, featuring pop-cultural and Cold War collectibles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/cd0507b5c0765d4dece1ddfcb79c965d.poster.avif?t=1757692850\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/cd0507b5c0765d4dece1ddfcb79c965d.webm?t=1757692850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/cd0507b5c0765d4dece1ddfcb79c965d.mp4?t=1757692850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/406998207338570cd844f29cebcfc90b.avif?t=1757692850\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the orphanage</strong> before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay low, stay quiet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues, solve puzzles, and unlock the path to freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up and survive the horror together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/0f0cb90ad3120c19f0c484391d0fa749.poster.avif?t=1757692850\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/0f0cb90ad3120c19f0c484391d0fa749.webm?t=1757692850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/0f0cb90ad3120c19f0c484391d0fa749.mp4?t=1757692850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ab1cacefd906cf67a43fd7e69d529004.avif?t=1757692850\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in Eastern Europe in the early 1980s. The orphans (players) must figure out how to escape alive from an orphanage that harbors terrible, evil secrets. The caretakers, priests and nuns, are members of a satanic cult and the time has come for the final s\u00e9ance where all the orphans are to be sacrificed to unleash demonic forces on the world and bring demonic power to earth by the &quot;Child Eater&quot;. Secret story elements are revealed by playing through the game multiple times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/f74d8983b804bdef2193e6d3f548600d.poster.avif?t=1757692850\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/f74d8983b804bdef2193e6d3f548600d.webm?t=1757692850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/f74d8983b804bdef2193e6d3f548600d.mp4?t=1757692850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3170640?t=1757692850","background_raw":"h